  m_Text: "\u25A0Game Rules\n > Don't get hit by falling numbers\n > Keep our character
    within the view\n > Keep going up to win\n > Press A / D to move left / right\n
    > Press Left Shift to Dash\n > Press Tab to Shrink or Grow\n > Drag a falling
    number with Left Click to move it\n > Get Shield to fend off falling numbers"
